WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:06.883
Eliza's trap.

00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:16.107
Summer vacation spent in Scotland
left Candy with many memories.

00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:24.223
And it was Terry who stood out the most
in those memories.

00:00:34.252 --> 00:00:42.573
After returning to London, the town, school
and everything else looked gray to Candy.

00:00:56.859 --> 00:01:00.932
A punk. I'm never going to see him again after that!

00:01:01.096 --> 00:01:02.194
I hate him!

00:01:03.317 --> 00:01:05.268
Uh... Candy?

00:01:06.447 --> 00:01:08.649
Aww, when did you...?

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:12.461
We kept knocking but there was no answer...

00:01:13.563 --> 00:01:15.139
Sorry, sorry!

00:01:15.835 --> 00:01:18.477
Candy, is something troubling you?

00:01:18.685 --> 00:01:21.124
Troubling me?
Not at all!

00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:24.523
But ever since we returned from Scotland,
Candy, you've been acting strange.

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:25.815
Right, Patty?

00:01:27.245 --> 00:01:28.908
I'm just playing around!

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:32.601
That's right! I was about to write a letter.

00:01:32.485 --> 00:01:33.646
A letter?

00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:36.649
To Grandfather William.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.872
It's not like he's going to reply, anyway!

00:01:40.488 --> 00:01:44.813
Let's see... Thank you very much
for the fun summer vacation...

00:01:50.383 --> 00:01:53.343
Even Stear and Archie got a nice tan!

00:01:54.327 --> 00:01:58.853
Now my freckles stand out even more.

00:02:02.573 --> 00:02:04.939
New semester begins tomorrow...?

00:02:06.228 --> 00:02:08.708
I'm gonna have to live by the rulebook again.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.463
In order to tighten your loose spirits
after the summer vacation,

00:02:26.629 --> 00:02:29.406
...we'll double the time of today's holy mass.

00:02:32.853 --> 00:02:34.147
Quiet!

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.599
Oh, boy. From today, we're back
to our lives by the rulebook.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:40.976
Terry isn't here.

00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:44.539
Is he still playing around in Scotland?

00:02:45.356 --> 00:02:48.649
Candice White Adley!
What are you looking at?

00:02:49.543 --> 00:02:50.602
...Yes!

00:03:04.826 --> 00:03:08.390
Maybe the dazzling summer sky of Scotland
was a bit too much.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.988
Ever since I came back to this school,
everything seems so dark.

00:03:18.286 --> 00:03:19.662
Hurry, hurry!

00:03:29.519 --> 00:03:32.177
Excuse me. Miss, are you alright?

00:03:32.589 --> 00:03:33.778
Yes, I'm fine!

00:03:35.677 --> 00:03:38.353
Could this be Grandfather William...?

00:03:42.191 --> 00:03:44.750
Uh... excuse me but...

00:03:45.895 --> 00:03:49.746
...are you Terry's... no, I mean,
Terrius's father?

00:03:51.161 --> 00:03:52.251
That's correct.

00:03:53.354 --> 00:03:59.143
I'm Eliza Leagan, a very good friend of Terry's...

00:03:59.726 --> 00:04:01.652
My, my.

00:04:01.949 --> 00:04:05.520
-Uh...
-Sorry, but I'm here to have a word with Director.

00:04:05.856 --> 00:04:09.270
Well then, it was nice to meet you. Please!

00:04:10.272 --> 00:04:12.446
Uh, I...
Well then.

00:04:15.001 --> 00:04:17.069
So that man was Terry's father?

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:21.605
Just what business does he have in this school?

00:04:22.481 --> 00:04:26.299
My, my, isn't this Duke Grandchester.
Welcome.

00:04:28.718 --> 00:04:29.755
Take this.

00:04:31.192 --> 00:04:34.173
I'm grateful for your usual
contribution for education...

00:04:34.953 --> 00:04:37.103
Is my son doing well?

00:04:37.611 --> 00:04:41.883
Y...yes. Lately he's been doing a little too well.

00:04:42.072 --> 00:04:47.481
-Actually, I'd like to speak to him in private.
-Very well. I'll call him immediately.

00:04:47.467 --> 00:04:49.891
No, you don't have to. I'll go over to him.

00:04:58.913 --> 00:04:59.779
Terrius.

00:05:02.752 --> 00:05:03.848
I'd like to talk to you.

00:05:03.984 --> 00:05:05.242
Sit down.

00:05:08.951 --> 00:05:12.246
I received a letter from Eleanor.

00:05:12.878 --> 00:05:15.100
She wrote about how she wants
you to live at her place.

00:05:17.844 --> 00:05:21.306
You still want to see that woman?

00:05:21.655 --> 00:05:24.062
"That woman?"
That's my mother!

00:05:24.544 --> 00:05:26.528
Moreover, she is someone
you used to love before!

00:05:27.798 --> 00:05:29.112
That's history!

00:05:36.161 --> 00:05:40.932
You are a Grandchester.
I'd like you to think more of your honour.

00:05:41.146 --> 00:05:45.278
I see. Were you guided by that honour
when you parted from Eleanor Baker?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.435
Shut up!

00:05:48.205 --> 00:05:50.621
You will never see Eleanor again!

00:05:51.071 --> 00:05:53.975
If you still choose to, I will disown you!

00:05:57.727 --> 00:06:01.416
She thinks about me
so much more than my father.

00:06:01.981 --> 00:06:04.030
I won't follow in my father's footsteps.

00:06:04.236 --> 00:06:07.853
If I lead myself by the fabled honour of the
Grandchester family, what is going to become of her?

00:06:12.068 --> 00:06:14.888
I'll never become the kind of person my father is!

00:06:21.009 --> 00:06:23.089
Candy, it's here! A letter!

00:06:23.286 --> 00:06:25.111
It's from Grandfather William, right?

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:27.346
It's finally here!

00:06:27.615 --> 00:06:28.785
Here you go.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.702
Thanks.

00:06:29.923 --> 00:06:30.737
Huh?

00:06:31.868 --> 00:06:33.608
It's from mr. Albert!

00:06:33.673 --> 00:06:34.946
...from Africa.

00:06:36.533 --> 00:06:37.579
See you.

00:06:37.643 --> 00:06:38.916
Thank you, Patty!

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.381
Africa?

00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:48.686
Dear Candy,

00:06:48.871 --> 00:06:50.407
I'm in Africa right now.

00:06:50.968 --> 00:06:56.997
I wanted to bid you farewell when I was leaving London,
but you already went to Summer school in Scotland.

00:07:00.296 --> 00:07:02.743
There are so many wild animals living here!

00:07:03.446 --> 00:07:08.004
I noticed how these wild animals are
so much livelier than those entrapped in zoos.

00:07:08.889 --> 00:07:11.590
It's best when animals and people live naturally.

00:07:12.209 --> 00:07:14.478
The same way you are living naturally, am I right?

00:07:14.527 --> 00:07:16.519
What's the meaning of this?

00:07:16.836 --> 00:07:21.332
Yes, yes, I'd like you to send my regards to yet
another one who is living naturally - to Terry.

00:07:23.738 --> 00:07:28.268
Right now, I'm working in a small hospital,
taking care of animals.

00:07:29.356 --> 00:07:33.598
I'm sure that you'd like to spend a few... no,
I think you'd like to live here forever.

00:07:34.579 --> 00:07:36.087
Africa...?

00:07:43.886 --> 00:07:48.321
Let's see, London is here...
he sure did come a long way...

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:51.675
I finally got to see you
and you went away again.

00:07:51.832 --> 00:07:54.249
Is this mr. Albert's way of life?

00:08:16.802 --> 00:08:17.645
Hi.

00:08:18.029 --> 00:08:19.654
Don't get too familiar.

00:08:20.439 --> 00:08:23.602
I don't intend to forgive you yet!

00:08:23.802 --> 00:08:25.620
And I don't intend to apologize.

00:08:26.496 --> 00:08:28.250
You're rude!

00:08:28.968 --> 00:08:32.586
If you keep making those faces,
you'll end up looking like sister Gray.

00:08:33.745 --> 00:08:37.360
Just to make it clear,
I'm not here to see you.

00:08:38.099 --> 00:08:38.983
Oh?

00:08:41.359 --> 00:08:42.230
Here.

00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:44.780
It's from mr. Albert!

00:08:46.237 --> 00:08:50.992
I thought you might want to read it
since he wrote so much about you!

00:08:56.312 --> 00:08:57.813
Africa...

00:08:58.185 --> 00:09:00.461
What a pity, I counted on him...

00:09:00.628 --> 00:09:03.639
You counted on him to rescue you
when you pick a fight again?

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.905
If I was to be driven out of the house...
I wanted to ask him to let me be his assistant.

00:09:09.267 --> 00:09:13.438
Terry... this has something to do with
the time your father came to see you?

00:09:14.144 --> 00:09:14.928
Maybe.

00:09:15.086 --> 00:09:17.884
Does this have anything to do
with your real mother?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.345
You'd better concentrate on your studies!

00:09:22.267 --> 00:09:23.842
You're making fun of me again!

00:09:24.695 --> 00:09:26.804
Finally, you're back to your usual self.

00:09:26.968 --> 00:09:29.601
But... you only speak these rude things...

00:09:30.319 --> 00:09:34.290
-Anyway, can I take it easy reading the letter?
-Feel free to.

00:09:45.483 --> 00:09:49.894
It's regrettable, but I feel completely
relaxed when I'm next to Terry.

00:09:57.791 --> 00:09:59.634
I thought things were like this...

00:10:00.305 --> 00:10:03.578
Candy is... Candy is going after Terry...

00:10:03.643 --> 00:10:04.989
I'll show you!

00:10:41.473 --> 00:10:43.866
Hello! It's been a while since
last time we were out!

00:10:47.809 --> 00:10:50.628
*Dopey Anime Fansub*
I made a few awkward blunders in translation while
rushing out the first 29 eps. Now it's bugging me.

00:10:53.159 --> 00:10:54.063
Let's go!

00:11:07.282 --> 00:11:09.990
Lady, suddenly jumping in front of me
like this is dangerous!

00:11:10.267 --> 00:11:13.391
Terry, I'd like to give you a word of warning.

00:11:13.803 --> 00:11:16.833
Can't we leave this for some other time?
My horse wants to run.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.135
I know that girl very well.

00:11:21.342 --> 00:11:22.333
What?

00:11:22.601 --> 00:11:23.774
I'm talking about Candy.

00:11:24.557 --> 00:11:25.489
Oh?

00:11:26.537 --> 00:11:27.835
So you want to hear.

00:11:29.015 --> 00:11:30.628
You look like you
can't wait to get it out.

00:11:31.598 --> 00:11:34.321
You see, that girl was our servant.

00:11:34.506 --> 00:11:36.719
She was very good being what she was!

00:11:36.717 --> 00:11:37.468
And?

00:11:37.629 --> 00:11:42.763
She caught the eye of grandfather William,
who adopted her into the Adley family.

00:11:42.798 --> 00:11:43.574
And?

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.833
But that girl is actually a thief!

00:11:47.491 --> 00:11:51.280
She took mama's necklace and my jewelery and then
pretended like she knew nothing about them!

00:11:51.435 --> 00:11:53.904
Even now, you can never be sure
what she is thinking about!

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:59.687
She gets violent as soon as you give
her a mean look; she even hurt Neil!

00:12:00.088 --> 00:12:04.458
If you keep hanging around such a girl, you could
tarnish the reputation of the Grandchester family!

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.156
Thank you for your warning.

00:12:09.107 --> 00:12:12.889
In return, I'd like you to warn Candy about me.

00:12:14.627 --> 00:12:18.643
Terry likes to smoke and drink during the holy mass.

00:12:18.684 --> 00:12:22.111
He doesn't even know the number of fights
he's been into, but probably tens of thousands.

00:12:22.157 --> 00:12:26.823
His dad's dough bought him a place in this school,
but in reality, he's just a good-for-nothing bum.

00:12:27.313 --> 00:12:28.335
Terry!

00:12:29.296 --> 00:12:33.474
Tell her that the reputation of the Adleys
could be tarnished, if she hooks up with such a guy.

00:12:34.118 --> 00:12:35.485
Wait up, Terry!

00:12:35.614 --> 00:12:39.370
Eliza, you should look yourself in the mirror now.

00:12:39.715 --> 00:12:42.775
Because you'd see the archetype
of an insane, badmouthing woman.

00:12:43.044 --> 00:12:44.015
Go!

00:12:48.824 --> 00:12:50.144
He made fun of me...

00:12:50.327 --> 00:12:52.161
Terrius made fun of me!

00:12:52.658 --> 00:12:57.364
He insulted me from that horse...
It's... he carried Candy on that horse!

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:03.444
I won't forgive you!

00:13:18.224 --> 00:13:20.033
Africa is amazing.

00:13:21.677 --> 00:13:22.739
Candy.

00:13:23.539 --> 00:13:24.872
What is it, Patty?

00:13:25.365 --> 00:13:26.602
Just a sec.

00:13:41.795 --> 00:13:43.294
Say, Patty, where are we going?

00:13:43.545 --> 00:13:45.385
I'm sorry, but I was too afraid to go alone!

00:13:45.627 --> 00:13:46.628
Afriaid?

00:13:46.666 --> 00:13:47.600
This way.

00:13:52.798 --> 00:13:54.083
Nobody is watching us?

00:13:54.845 --> 00:13:55.487
No...

00:13:55.446 --> 00:13:58.457
-A letter? Who are you going to send it to?
-It's our post.

00:14:00.713 --> 00:14:02.120
Our post?

00:14:04.318 --> 00:14:05.800
So that is post?

00:14:06.418 --> 00:14:07.529
Got it!

00:14:07.871 --> 00:14:10.679
I'd like my letter to arrive safely, too!

00:14:13.034 --> 00:14:15.451
Say, Patty... who sent you this letter?

00:14:16.475 --> 00:14:17.797
Stear did.

00:14:18.816 --> 00:14:22.637
So you and Stear are using
that tree to exchange letters?

00:14:23.617 --> 00:14:26.215
-Patty, you're going at it!
-Aww, come on!

00:14:32.165 --> 00:14:33.627
Patty, a patrol.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:44.167
Wow, I'm jealous!

00:14:44.699 --> 00:14:47.246
You're exchanging letters every day!

00:14:47.384 --> 00:14:51.220
I had no idea that Patty and Stear
have become such close friends!

00:14:51.402 --> 00:14:56.194
It's not like that... we're just consulting
each other about our daily events...

00:14:58.236 --> 00:15:04.649
Come to think of it, even though it's the same school,
boys and girls meet only during the prayer' time.

00:15:05.785 --> 00:15:07.903
You'll excuse me now.

00:15:08.079 --> 00:15:10.518
There is still some time before
sisters go on patrol!

00:15:10.707 --> 00:15:13.097
No, I want to write a reply!

00:15:13.281 --> 00:15:15.000
But you just sent one!

00:15:15.035 --> 00:15:16.776
But... good night!

00:15:20.937 --> 00:15:24.865
I can't believe that this Stear guy
is writing all those letters!

00:15:32.888 --> 00:15:35.600
I'm better with inventions than I'm with letters...

00:15:39.304 --> 00:15:40.393
Brother!

00:15:40.758 --> 00:15:42.073
Sorry, sorry. I hit you?

00:16:09.932 --> 00:16:12.496
Huh? It's a different kind of envelope.

00:16:21.495 --> 00:16:22.644
Candy!

00:16:22.724 --> 00:16:23.964
Candy!

00:16:25.197 --> 00:16:26.595
I'm here, Patty!

00:16:27.345 --> 00:16:29.988
Candy, I found this in my secret post!

00:16:30.793 --> 00:16:34.175
Okay, you don't have to make me read
Stear's letters...

00:16:34.657 --> 00:16:37.196
When I opened it, it was addressed to you!

00:16:37.361 --> 00:16:38.711
To me?

00:16:42.931 --> 00:16:44.469
I'd like to talk to you about some
very important matters.

00:16:45.337 --> 00:16:47.905
Tonight at 8 o'clock, I'll be waiting
in the barn. Terrius.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.875
Once you read this letter, destroy it immediately.

00:16:51.904 --> 00:16:53.319
Thank you, Patty!

00:16:53.717 --> 00:16:54.852
Candy...

00:16:56.442 --> 00:17:01.017
Terry heard about this tree-post from Stear,
and he used it to reach me.

00:17:01.474 --> 00:17:04.178
But those important matters... what is it about?

00:17:27.376 --> 00:17:29.364
An important discussion.
What's the meaning of that?

00:17:29.876 --> 00:17:33.444
Maybe he's leaving to America
in order to live with his real mother?

00:17:48.735 --> 00:17:49.937
Terry!

00:17:50.275 --> 00:17:51.291
I'm right here!

00:17:59.792 --> 00:18:01.467
Where are you, Terry?

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.364
Now that was scary.

00:18:07.532 --> 00:18:10.341
Why did you call me out here
at this hour?

00:18:11.328 --> 00:18:13.620
But... it was you who called me, right?

00:18:14.091 --> 00:18:15.402
What?

00:18:16.172 --> 00:18:19.063
You put the note underneath the door of my room.

00:18:19.771 --> 00:18:23.252
I also got a letter that mentioned
an important discussion...

00:18:23.793 --> 00:18:25.437
Did you bring that letter?

00:18:25.629 --> 00:18:29.094
That is... it said that I should
destroy it immediately after reading...

00:18:30.072 --> 00:18:31.532
It's the same idea.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:50.310
Just what are you two doing?!
Are you trying to ruin the reputation of this school?!

00:18:50.508 --> 00:18:52.241
That's not true, sister Gray!

00:18:55.902 --> 00:18:57.889
Eliza!
You...!

00:18:58.131 --> 00:19:00.529
Looks like the rumours were true.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:03.509
The two of you really are seeing
each other in this barn.

00:19:05.224 --> 00:19:07.257
You liar! Eliza!

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:11.192
Eliza! I couldn't despise you
more than I do now.

00:19:11.732 --> 00:19:15.270
Oh, I just came here to see
whether the rumours were true or not.

00:19:15.903 --> 00:19:16.838
This is a ploy!

00:19:17.827 --> 00:19:19.685
Candice White Adley!

00:19:19.866 --> 00:19:21.549
You are expelled from the school!

00:19:21.868 --> 00:19:23.310
Expelled?

00:19:24.769 --> 00:19:28.446
Until your family arrives to pick you up,
you will be confined to the tower!

00:19:28.848 --> 00:19:29.930
Take her away!

00:19:30.433 --> 00:19:31.886
Please wait, director Gray!

00:19:31.985 --> 00:19:33.647
Please listen to me!

00:19:33.961 --> 00:19:35.178
What are you doing?

00:19:35.101 --> 00:19:36.179
Please wait!

00:19:37.458 --> 00:19:38.193
Terry!

00:19:38.334 --> 00:19:39.145
Candy!

00:19:40.879 --> 00:19:43.130
Terry! Terry!

00:19:44.405 --> 00:19:45.510
Candy!

00:19:45.905 --> 00:19:51.210
Terrius G. Grandchester!
You are confined to your room for a week!

00:19:51.564 --> 00:19:55.194
She and I did the same thing,
so why wasn't I expelled?

00:19:55.582 --> 00:19:57.937
Knowing you, I have more sympathy
for actions from your behalf.

00:19:58.565 --> 00:20:03.738
That's right! She was persistently all over him
during the time in Summer school in Scotland!

00:20:03.773 --> 00:20:05.765
Eliza! Bitches like you...

00:20:06.355 --> 00:20:09.822
Terrius! I won't tolerate violence
right in front of me!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.775
Let me out!

00:20:29.134 --> 00:20:35.013
I was framed by Eliza!
Please hear me, director Gray!

00:20:57.029 --> 00:21:02.314
Grandfather William... you...
you would've believed me, would you?

00:21:02.845 --> 00:21:04.037
You would've believed me!

00:21:06.906 --> 00:21:09.132
Candy cried loudly.

00:21:09.406 --> 00:21:11.263
She shouted loudly.

00:21:11.967 --> 00:21:17.328
She felt as if she was being engulfed
by the silent darkness.

00:21:17.476 --> 00:21:20.075
To be continued...
